+
+#### [AnythingLLM](https://github.com/Mintplex-Labs/anything-llm)
+> **Description:** AnythingLLM calls itself an all-in-one AI productivity accelerator with a privacy-first, on-device deployment model. The README focuses on workspaces, document ingestion, embeddings, chat over private files, and straightforward setup rather than deep infrastructure work. That makes it a practical fit for smaller insurance agencies that want carrier appetite guides, underwriting memos, endorsement templates, and renewal instructions searchable through a secure assistant. It is MIT licensed, self-hostable, and comparatively quick to pilot for teams that want results before they want framework complexity.
+
+- **GitHub:** [github.com/Mintplex-Labs/anything-llm](https://github.com/Mintplex-Labs/anything-llm)
