+> **Description:** LibreChat presents itself as an enhanced self-hosted chat workspace with support for multiple model providers, agents, MCP tools, web search, code execution, presets, artifacts, and secure multi-user access. Its README is unusually broad, making it appealing for insurance operations that need one interface for knowledge assistants, document chat, internal prompts, and controlled access across CSRs, producers, and managers. Because it is MIT licensed and actively maintained, it works well as a front-end layer for teams that want a ChatGPT-style experience without putting proprietary customer context in a closed SaaS dashboard.
