+> **Description:** RAGFlow describes itself as a leading open-source RAG engine that combines high-quality retrieval with agent capabilities to create a stronger context layer for LLMs. The README leans heavily into document-heavy, retrieval-centric workloads, which is directly relevant for insurance teams handling manuals, notices, applications, binders, and claims correspondence. It is a strong fit when document understanding quality matters more than chat polish. GitHub shows Apache-2.0 licensing, substantial community interest, and very active development, making it one of the most credible open-source backbones for insurance knowledge operations.
