+> **Description:** FastGPT’s README describes a knowledge-based AI platform with built-in data processing, model invocation, visual workflows, knowledge bases, debugging, and agent-style orchestration. The project is particularly relevant to insurance operators who want to combine document retrieval, customer-facing Q&A, and internal process automation in one deployable stack. Its emphasis on out-of-the-box capabilities reduces setup cost for teams that need usable workflows quickly. The repo is large, active, and centered on practical AI application building rather than experimentation, which makes it a credible open-source option for servicing and ops use cases.
