+> This curated list of the best AI tools for insurance agents in 2026 focuses only on public GitHub repositories that can be self-hosted, audited, extended, or integrated into an agency workflow. Because the niche is narrow, the list deliberately broadens into the real operating stack insurance teams need: document AI, knowledge search, transcription, CRM, customer support, and workflow automation.
