+#### [Flowise](https://github.com/FlowiseAI/Flowise)
+> **Description:** Flowise describes itself as a visual builder for AI agents and LLM apps. Its README centers on drag-and-drop orchestration, reusable components, prompt chaining, and self-hosting with Docker or Node. For insurance teams, that maps well to quote intake bots, renewal workflows, policy document Q&A, and internal assistant prototypes without a heavy engineering lift. The project is Apache-2.0 licensed, has an active release cycle, and remains one of the strongest low-code entry points for building private AI flows on top of internal agency content.
