+#### [Docling](https://github.com/DS4SD/docling)
+> **Description:** Docling is presented by IBM Deep Search as a document-processing library that simplifies parsing many formats, including advanced PDF understanding, while integrating cleanly with the broader generative AI ecosystem. This is especially relevant for insurance agents because intake rarely starts with neat text. It starts with scanned ACORD forms, policy packets, loss runs, carrier guidelines, and endorsements. Docling helps normalize those sources into structured content that downstream RAG systems can actually use. The project is actively maintained and has quickly become one of the strongest open-source choices for document-heavy AI workflows.
